{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":534976,\"title\":\"Long Live, Girls\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"The plot of the film is based on real events that took place in the summer of 1958 on one of the beaches of Absheron, when Tofik Huseynov, a schoolboy from Baku, drowned in the sea while saving drowning children. The film begins before the opening credits: on a deserted beach by the raging sea, a young man, exhausted, pulls drowning girls out of the waves. One, then another, then a third... Then he rushes for the fourth, but drowns with her.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sajc0Lxa8yaSJwjL4rzZl46K3zo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hzs3nvfivWNwdE0YDlZ6HYiZipg.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":1973,\"runtime\":87,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"SU\",\"name\":\"Soviet Union\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Eldar Guliyev\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2043816,\"name\":\"Eldar Guliyev\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jwyk7ej4CgHrcIndqgYWhkFZC5Y.jpg\"},{\"id\":2042644,\"name\":\"Rafael Dadashov\",\"character\":\"Isa\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/waiafKsCZVeZhiFVvbSqjUfX9sb.jpg\"},{\"id\":2063047,\"name\":\"Valentina Aslanova\",\"character\":\"Solmaz\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/skISofbG109eSyyD9xMtjVChxQu.jpg\"},{\"id\":2081597,\"name\":\"Yelena Chukhray\",\"character\":\"Sona\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2081599,\"name\":\"Nurangiz Guliyeva\",\"character\":\"Zeynab\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2042402,\"name\":\"Hasanagha Turabov\",\"character\":\"Shamsi\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6VvWHZ9L0ig5dYK2adv9Ringr4H.jpg\"},{\"id\":1811692,\"name\":\"Anar Rzayev\",\"character\":\"Murad\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2042889,\"name\":\"Süsan Macidova\",\"character\":\"Shahla\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nGBZVyekMrbASmraMZEbp45OzcH.jpg\"},{\"id\":2042408,\"name\":\"Sofa Basirzade\",\"character\":\"Sakina\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lUlgvSfQVTKwl153ykbkUq7Fxoj.jpg\"},{\"id\":2043766,\"name\":\"Omur Naghiyev\",\"character\":\"Rustam\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Als9pdMGIjgVuKIATEQ08rnXYnm.jpg\"},{\"id\":2043716,\"name\":\"Sadiq Hasanzada\",\"character\":\"Rustam's Father\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x8z7VpOI7OKBXfQtdsRHezWtoOV.jpg\"},{\"id\":2042482,\"name\":\"Sadaya Mustafayeva\",\"character\":\"Rustam's Mother\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xDbUx9eAhEtOvwXKplGEoM57uzM.jpg\"},{\"id\":2078003,\"name\":\"Arzu Safarova\",\"character\":\"Nigar\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2043819,\"name\":\"Tatyana Kharitonova\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1485038,\"name\":\"Mukhtar Maniyev\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fuXqoh9exir70FYUId4qNLNGdnL.jpg\"},{\"id\":2042486,\"name\":\"Huseynagha Sadigov\",\"character\":\"Gambar\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fJ2YuUj27ZFY0so3yf1Y8SSgfzk.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":453,\"title\":\"A Beautiful Mind\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rEIg5yJdNOt9fmX4P8gU9LeNoTQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hCJFWTPghXCwwSpvPpAoIB8318Q.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"From the heights of notoriety to the depths of depravity, John Forbes Nash Jr. experiences it all. As a brilliant but socially awkward mathematician, he made a groundbreaking discovery early in his career and stands on the brink of international acclaim. But as the handsome and arrogant Nash accepts secret work in cryptography, he becomes entangled in a mysterious conspiracy. His life takes a nightmarish turn and he soon finds himself on a painful and harrowing journey of self-discovery.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":266856,\"title\":\"The Theory of Everything\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7kwcLFNt887saoQAL7EY0XnW7VI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dh2QT3TPtAQf057yeLpNMuaJlmp.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Once a healthy, active young man, Hawking received an earth-shattering diagnosis at 21 years of age. With Jane fighting tirelessly by his side, Stephen embarks on his most ambitious scientific work, studying the very thing he now has precious little of – time.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":69,\"title\":\"Walk the Line\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p8lPTjvjOjTfvC1E9pmMwcF9vkn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pMBKzEotLUzk3NuQiyVjZEDlH70.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A chronicle of country music legend Johnny Cash's life, from his early days on an Arkansas cotton farm to his rise to fame with Sun Records in Memphis, where he recorded alongside Elvis Presley, Jerry Lee Lewis and Carl Perkins.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":26022,\"title\":\"My Name Is Khan\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5Y36lCiNyyV71mjq6LavgiggbhT.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zGCnIADWwpjGllYv8DgT8HIuIQl.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Rizwan Khan, a Muslim from the Borivali section of Mumbai, has Asperger's syndrome. He marries a Hindu single mother, Mandira, in San Francisco. After 9/11, Rizwan is detained by authorities at LAX who treat him as a terrorist because of his condition and his race.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":921,\"title\":\"Cinderella Man\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wkeOjIcpuqLMW4GnVowlM9VI0JE.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oO5sMDETneOPCneX3jfXMFfPh9E.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The true story of boxer Jim Braddock who, following his retirement in the 1930s, makes a surprise comeback in order to lift his family out of poverty.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Drama\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":454527,\"title\":\"Benedetta\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yofVXmLYQbr8pdOeyDRrf9N8rF4.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b2L7jOgo5cHiRIvljD2GCqZiYO2.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A 17th-century nun becomes entangled in a forbidden lesbian affair with a novice. But it is Benedetta's shocking religious visions that threaten to shake the Church to its core.\",\"genres\":[\"History\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11661,\"title\":\"Joyeux Noel\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9Ka8lKCIiWjnZiMslPQeakS5UhW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5ChBhGXIX7RgOMSjIlXgBp6UjMf.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"France, 1914, during World War I. On Christmas Eve, an extraordinary event takes place in the bloody no man's land that the French and the Scots dispute with the Germans…\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"War\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":416477,\"title\":\"The Big Sick\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9fJTT8pBxxQsFILJHTtHhdYFr77.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fYI8WX2DquAHMqwh5mOMxc6RU5j.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Pakistan-born comedian Kumail Nanjiani and grad student Emily Gardner fall in love but struggle as their cultures clash. When Emily contracts a mysterious illness, Kumail finds himself forced to face her feisty parents, his family's expectations, and his true feelings.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":72570,\"title\":\"The Vow\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/y5GUXzTvt7kSQbdQrSvbYNoa8HB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a8IFeO1BMn4QEfLsf41Ml7LodyC.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Happy young married couple Paige and Leo are, well, happy. Then a car accident puts Paige into a life-threatening coma. Upon awakening she has lost the previous five years of memories, including those of her beloved Leo, her wedding, a confusing relationship with her parents, or the ending of her relationship with her ex-fiance. Despite these complications, Leo endeavors to win her heart again and rebuild their marriage.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":719410,\"title\":\"Your Name Engraved Herein\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ynNO5FhArEz68wRKOn4NgqVntmS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rhsvTWUeH6RKXk8pQ830oBw56qb.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1987, as martial law ends in Taiwan, Jia-han and Birdy fall in love amid family pressure, homophobia and social stigma.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":407445,\"title\":\"Breathe\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wLu2N0QVfSpk10RJ17HLHyRUmww.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/quVfDYktBYQfojgZ3E9pYrclGse.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Based on the true story of Robin, a handsome, brilliant and adventurous man whose life takes a dramatic turn when polio leaves him paralyzed.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1371185,\"title\":\"Song Sung Blue\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xStmzLprgzqjzfvpBI7uTbcRpwQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8dlna8rRcf5gDCRzEsjtHizpj1X.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Based on a true story, two down-on-their-luck musicians form a joyous Neil Diamond tribute band, proving it's never too late to find love and follow your dreams.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"OJ0Frq-C8As\",\"nam